From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:13:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 265/289] [ae-patch] Re-read the Usage card after a login
 switch until the runner stamps the new login

The server answers the card from the runner's launch-time label, which is written only after the terminal relaunches, so the single re-read after the switch saw the old login and the next one came 60 s later. Re-read the Usage numbers again at 2, 5, 12 and 30 s.
